<title>south africa: CRICKET - AUSTRALIA BEAT EASTERN PROVINCE XI.</title>
<headline>CRICKET - AUSTRALIA BEAT EASTERN PROVINCE XI.</headline>
<dateline>ZWIDE 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat an Eastern Province Invitation XI by 15 runs in a 45 over game in Zwide close to Port Elizabeth on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Australia: 243-4 (Matthew Hayden 68, Justin Langer 56, Michael Bevan 57 not out)</p>
<p>E.P.Invitation XI: 228-8 (Louis Koen 78)</p>
